<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97587" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαίω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαθ-κάω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾱ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set on fire with</i> or <i>at once, burn up</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				22c
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be burnt up, calcined</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				49c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				129.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, etc.; also of the effect of intense cold,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.118
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>overheat, inflame</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ οἶνος] ς. τὰς φλέβας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα ς. τὴν κοιλίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>VM</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.559
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ συγκεκαυμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Prodic.
					4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλίη συνεκαύθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.26
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ́</span>:—intr. in 
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλίαι συγκαίειν
			ἀγαθαί</span> liable <i>to inflame</i>,
				Id.<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
